    <textTemplates>
        <name>CaseCreationCLFCaseTemplate</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>true</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>Subject: We’re on it: Your request for contact from RingCentral

Hello {!$Record.ContactName__c} ,

My name is {!$Record.Owner:User.Full_Name__c}, and I&apos;m a Customer Experience Manager at RingCentral. We truly appreciate you taking the time today to share your feedback with us. Although this message was sent automatically, I will personally review and respond to any replies you send.

In your response, you mentioned that you would like to speak to someone about your experience, so I would be happy to set some time up to discuss.
To move forward, please choose your preferred method:

•        1. Simply reply to this email to discuss your feedback.
•        2. If you prefer a quick call, please provide your preferred phone number and a good time to reach you (including timezone).

I look forward to hearing from you soon!

Thank you!
{!$Record.Owner:User.Full_Name__c}
Customer Experience Manager</text>
